# Only the git-install path reads this file: npm packs a clone of this
# repository when someone runs `npx github:RatmmmhSquishyRat/agent-coexist`,
# and without an .npmignore it falls back to .gitignore and warns. The root
# package.json is private and never published, and the registry artifact in
# packaging/npm/ selects its own contents through package.json "files", so
# nothing here affects either registry.
#
# Keep packaging/ and drop everything only the Rust build needs.
/src/
/tests/
/vendor/
/target/
/docs/
/.github/
/.cargo/
/.agents/
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
deny.toml
rust-toolchain.toml
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
